@startuml
!include ../themes/dark-theme.puml
title Post-Authentication – Password Reset Check

legend top
Entry point:
Authentication completed
(MFA satisfied if required)
end legend

start

:Perform password reset check\n[[password_reset/Perform%20Password%20Reset%20Check.puml details]];

:Load security state;
note right
  Data requested:
  - password_reset_required

  Purpose:
  - Enforce mandatory reset
  - Must occur AFTER MFA
end note

if (Password reset required?) then (yes)
  :Issue password-reset-scoped token; <<warning>>

  note right
    Token parameters:
    - type: password_reset
    - audience: auth.password_reset
    - ttl: 15 minutes
    - permissions: change_password
    - single_use: true
    - terminal_flow: true

    Security guarantees:
    - no access token issued
    - no refresh token issued
    - all existing sessions invalidated
  end note

  :Return PASSWORD_RESET_REQUIRED;
  :Terminate login attempt;
  end
endif

:Continue authentication\n(Authorization & Token Issuance);

end
@enduml
